.TH DAMX 1 "2026-10-07" "DAMX 1.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
damx \- Div Acer Manager Max GUI for Acer laptops
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B damx
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B damx
is the graphical front-end of Div Acer Manager Max. It talks to the DAMX daemon
over the Unix socket
.I /var/run/DAMX.sock
and exposes performance profiles, fan control, battery charge limiting and
calibration, keyboard backlight control, LCD override and live hardware
telemetry on supported Acer laptops.
.PP
The application runs as the normal desktop user. Administrative actions are
performed by the daemon, which runs as root under systemd
.RI ( damx-daemon.service ).
.SH OPTIONS
The program accepts the standard Avalonia command-line options; no application
specific options are defined.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/DivAcerManagerMax/profiles.json
Saved custom profiles, fan curves and application preferences.
.TP
.I /var/log/DAMX_Daemon_Log.log
Daemon log file.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR damx-setup (1)
.SH AUTHOR
PXDiv and contributors.
